{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36604","headline":"春日忆湖南旧游寄卢校书 · 罗隐","name":"春日忆湖南旧游寄卢校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅榜前年过洞庭，曾提刀笔事甘宁。\n瑇筵离隔将军幕，朱履频窥处士星。\n恩重匣中孤劒在，梦余江畔数峰青。\n金貂见服嘉宾散，回首昭丘一涕零。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}